Package: sleek-code-browser
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Sleek Code Browser Team <support@sleek.local>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libstdc++6, libx11-6, libxext6, libxrender1, libxcb1, libglib2.0-0
Description: Sleek Code Browser
 Build prompt-ready source bundles from checked files in a project tree.
 Includes the sleek CLI, desktop launcher integration, and configurable exclusions.
